{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T06:39:07+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T06:39:07+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Amazon.com, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Internet Retail","country":"United States","city":"Seattle","website":"https://www.amazon.com","employees":1595000,"summary":"Amazon.com, Inc. engages in the retail sale of consumer products, advertising, and subscriptions service through online and physical stores in North America and internationally. The company operates through three segments: North America, International, and Amazon Web Services (AWS). It also manufactures and sells electronic devices, including Kindle, fire tablets, fire TVs, echo, ring, blink, and eero; and develops and produces media content. In addition, the company offers programs that enable sellers to sell their products in its stores; and programs that allow authors, independent publishers, musicians, filmmakers, Twitch streamers, skill and app developers, and others to publish and sell content. Further, it provides compute, storage, Artificial intelligence, database, analytics, machine learning, and other services, as well as advertising services through programs, such as sponsored ads, display, and video advertising. Additionally, the company offers Amazon Prime, a membership program. The company's products offered through its stores include merchandise and content purchased for resale and products offered by third-party sellers. It serves consumers, sellers, developers, enterprises, content creators, advertisers, and employees. The company was incorporated in 1994 and is headquartered in Seattle, Washington.","exchange":"NasdaqGS","currency":"USD","financial_currency":"USD","summary_fr":"Amazon.com, Inc. se livre à la vente au détail de produits de consommation, de publicité et de services d'abonnement dans les magasins en ligne et physiques en Amérique du Nord et à l'étranger. La société opère à travers trois segments: Amérique du Nord, International et Amazon Web Services (AWS). Il fabrique et vend également des appareils électroniques, y compris le Kindle, les tablettes de feu, les téléviseurs de feu, l'écho, l'anneau, le clignement et l'eero; et développe et produit du contenu multimédia. En outre, la société propose des programmes qui permettent aux vendeurs de vendre leurs produits dans ses magasins; et des programmes qui permettent aux auteurs, éditeurs indépendants, musiciens, cinéastes, streamers Twitch, développeurs de compétences et d'applications et autres de publier et de vendre du contenu. En outre, il fournit des services de calcul, de stockage, d'intelligence artificielle, de base de données, d'analyse, d'apprentissage automatique et d'autres services, ainsi que des services publicitaires par le biais de programmes, tels que des publicités sponsorisées, des affichages et de la publicité vidéo. En outre, la société propose Amazon Prime, un programme d'adhésion. Les produits de la société offerts dans ses magasins comprennent des marchandises et du contenu achetés pour la revente et des produits offerts par des vendeurs tiers. Il sert les consommateurs, les vendeurs, les développeurs, les entreprises, les créateurs de contenu, les annonceurs et les employés. La société a été constituée en 1994 et a son siège social à Seattle, dans l'État de Washington."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":2830004912128,"shares_outstanding":10786313572,"trailing_pe":21.107803,"forward_pe":25.11179,"price_to_book":5.128822,"ev_to_ebitda":17.516,"ev_to_revenue":3.814,"dividend_yield":0.0,"payout_ratio":0.0,"beta_yahoo":1.456},"targets":{"current_price":262.37,"mean":331.7243,"median":329.5,"high":405.0,"low":230.0,"n_analysts":58,"reco_mean":1.33333,"reco_key":"strong_buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-10-29"],"eps_avg":1.98071,"eps_low":1.85,"eps_high":2.22,"revenue_avg":202202785780,"ex_dividend":null,"dividend_da